    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mr. Mitty and the Itty Bitty Kitty Committee</h2><strong>Calling all cat fiends!</strong><br>Disaster has struck the island of cats! A ferocious storm has snatched the committee\u2019s important letters, plunging the feline paradise into chaos. But fear not, Mr. Mitty, is on the case!<br>Join Mr. Mitty on a purrfectly pawsome platforming adventure to recover the missing letters!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Leap, climb, and pounce across The Island's landscapes - from the bustling city rooftops to the calm beaches.<br></li><li>Explore every nook and cranny - No detail is too small for Mr. Mitty's sharp feline senses!<br></li><li>Save the day - Who will find the missing letters?</li></ul><br>Can Mr. Mitty defy gravity and restore harmony to the Island?<br><br><strong>Mr. Mitty and the Itty Bitty Kitty Committee: A purrfect blend of platforming, exploration, and friendship</strong>",
